apid ultrafilter is free, and every test function is eventually dominated pointwise by the increasing enumeration of some member.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (three-place function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\{a_n:n\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterRapidUltrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}rapid\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterRapidUltrafilter}_S(U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land U\\cap[\\omega]^{<\\omega}=\\varnothing\\land\\forall f\